@@ -79,2 +16,0 @@ Getting Started
-Docstrings
-~~~~~~~~~~
@@ -82,5 +17,0 @@ Docstrings
-Napoleon interprets every docstring that :mod:`autodoc <sphinx.ext.autodoc>`
-can find, including docstrings on: ``modules``, ``classes``, ``attributes``,
