-
-.. |alabaster|        image:: /_static/themes/alabaster.png
-.. |classic|          image:: /_static/themes/classic.png
-.. |sphinxdoc|        image:: /_static/themes/sphinxdoc.png
-.. |scrolls|          image:: /_static/themes/scrolls.png
